@ECommerce.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7237

### OpenAPI document
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### List brands (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/brands
Accept: application/json

###

### List product types (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/types
Accept: application/json

###

### List delivery methods (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods
Accept: application/json

###

### Create delivery method (admin, optional description)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Overnight Delivery",
  "deliveryTime": "Next business day",
  "price": 45.00,
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "description": "Delivered before 10 AM the next business day."
}

###

### Change delivery method description (admin, null clears it)
PATCH {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods/{id}/description
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Delivered before 10 AM the next business day."
}

###

### Toggle delivery method availability (admin)
PATCH {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods/{id}/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

###

### List products (paged)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Create product (replace brandId/typeId with values from /api/v1/brands and /api/v1/types)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Classic Tee",
  "description": "A comfortable cotton t-shirt.",
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/images/classic-tee.png",
  "price": 19.99,
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "brandId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###

### List my orders (authenticated — set the access token first)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

###

### Get my order by id (authenticated)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/<order-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

###

### Checkout the basket (authenticated; replaces deliveryMethodId/shippingAddressId with real values)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryMethodId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "shippingAddressId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###

### Cancel my own pending order (authenticated)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/<order-id>/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

###

### Ship order (admin)
PATCH {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/<order-id>/ship
Authorization: Bearer <admin-access-token>

###

### Deliver order (admin)
PATCH {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/<order-id>/deliver
Authorization: Bearer <admin-access-token>

###

### Cancel order (admin)
PATCH {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/<order-id>/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <admin-access-token>

###

### Stripe webhook (anonymous; Stripe sends raw JSON + Stripe-Signature header)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/webhooks/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=000000,v1=<signature>

{
  "id": "evt_test",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": { "object": { "id": "pi_test" } }
}

###
